"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1985-06-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"NO","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1985-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"SE","release_dates":[{"certification":"15","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1984-12-21T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"Austin Fantastic Fest","release_date":"2008-09-18T00:00:00.000Z","type":1},{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1984-11-16T00:00:00.000Z","type":3},{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"VHS","release_date":"1985-03-18T00:00:00.000Z","type":5},{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"DVD","release_date":"2009-11-11T00:00:00.000Z","type":5},{"certification":"R","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"Blu-ray","release_date":"2023-03-14T00:00:00.000Z","type":5}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"In the Australian outback a vicious wild boar kills and causes havoc to a small community.","tagline":"It's waiting outside and it can sense your fear. No nightmare will prepare you for it!"},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"Razorback","overview":"Un soir, dans une maison isolée au milieu du désert australien, un vieil homme, Jake Cullen, et son petit-fils Scotty sont attaqués par un sanglier monstrueux. L'enfant disparaît et le grand-père, amputé d'une jambe, est un moment accusé du meurtre. Deux ans plus tard, Beth Winters, journaliste américaine, débarque dans la région pour enquêter sur un massacre de kangourous…","tagline":"Tuez-la ou elle vous tuera…"},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Razorback - Oltre l'urlo del demonio","overview":"Nel deserto australiano, un vecchio cacciatore di canguri, Jake Cullen (Bill Kerr), vede qualcosa di mostruoso devastargli la casa e portargli via il nipotino. Accusato di aver fatto sparire il nipote ma assolto per insufficienza di prove, Jake si mette alla ricerca di quello che ritiene un gigantesco e feroce razorback, una specie di supercinghiale…","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Razorback - Kampfkoloß der Hölle","overview":"Gamulla ist ein kleiner Ort im australischen Busch. Hier lebt der alte Farmer Jack Cullen mit seinem zweijährigen Enkel Scotty. Eines Abends wird er durch ein merkwürdiges Geräusch aufgeschreckt und von einem riesigen Koloss zu Boden geworfen. Als er sich ins Haus schleppt, ist Scotty verschwunden. Vor Gericht glaubt niemand dem Alten die Geschichte von dem Koloss, und Jake wird wegen Mordes an seinem Enkel verurteilt. Jahre später macht sich die amerikanische Fernseh-Journalistin Beth Winters auf die Reise nach Australien. Man begegnet ihr nicht gerade herzlich. In Petpak Cannery trifft Beth auf die Brüder Benny und Dicko Baker. Von da an verliert sich ihre Spur. Auf der Suche nach seiner Frau findet ihr Ehemann, Carl Winters, in der hübschen Sarah Cameron eine beherzte Helferin, doch was sie gemeinsam erleben, übertrifft an Grausamkeit all ihre Befürchtungen.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Razorback: Los colmillos del infierno","overview":"Una especie de cerdo salvaje aterroriza y asesina gente en una aislada ciudad del interior de Australia. La primera víctima resulta ser un niño y después, una periodista americana. Su marido, Carl, quiere averiguar la verdad pero los habitantes de la zona no se muestran muy amistosos. Sólo contará con la ayuda de un cazador y una mujer para encontrar a la bestia.","tagline":"Razorback: Los colmillos del infierno"},{"iso_639_1":"hu","iso_3166_1":"HU","name":"Magyar","english_name":"Hungarian","title":"Pokolszülött","overview":"Egy veszélyes vadállat rettegésben tartja Ausztrália elhagyatott vidékét. Lehet, hogy az elveszett amerikai nő is a vérengző vadállat áldozatává vált? Férje nem hisz a jelentéseknek, és elhatározza, megverekszik a teremtménnyel, akár élete árán is.","tagline":"Négyszázötven kilogramm pusztító agyar és izom!"},{"iso_639_1":"bg","iso_3166_1":"BG","name":"български език","english_name":"Bulgarian","title":"Глиганът","overview":"Зловещ див глиган тероризира пустошта в Австралия, първата му жертва е малко дете чийто дядо е обвинен в убийството му. Следващата жертва е журналистка от Америка, нейният съпруг започва да търси истината за смъртта на жена си...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Кабан-секач","overview":"Где-то на бескрайних просторах Австралии бродит жуткое существо, которое может разорвать человека в клочья и разрушить ваш дом за считанные секунды. Это — секач, гигантское и безжалостное существо, страшное порождение природы, четырехсоткилограммовая тварь с острыми как бритва клыками. Когда в тех самых местах без следа исчезает американская журналистка, её муж отправляется на поиски пропавшей супруги и попадает в круговерть кошмара и ужаса.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"레저백","overview":"도시와 아주 떨어진 한 외딴 마을. 음산하고 독특한 분위기를 취재하기 위해 뉴욕에서 온 여기자. 적극적이며 극성파인 그녀는 마을을 누비며 취재를 하다 땅이 꺼지는 듯한 괴음과 함께 의문의 죽음을 당한다. 그녀의 연인 칼(Carl Winters: 그레고리 해리슨 분)은 직접 마을로와 그녀의 죽음을 파헤치고 마을에 오래 살았던 노인에게서 '레저백'의 정체를 알게 된다. 복수심에 레저백을 쫓아온 노인. 애인을 잃어버린 슬픔으로 집요한 추적을 벌이는 칼. 그들앞에 엄청난 요동 소리와 함께 서서히 모습을 드러내는 공포의 레저백.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"nl","iso_3166_1":"NL","name":"Nederlands","english_name":"Dutch","title":"","overview":"Op een verloren plek in de Australische woestijn, ten noorden van Sydney, woont de kangoeroejager Jake Gullen. Op een avond wordt Jake aangevallen door een reusachtig everzwijn dat zijn hoeve verwoest en zijn kleinzoon ontvoert. Niemand hecht enig geloof aan zijn verhaal. Wanneer de Amerikaanse journaliste Beth Winter tijdens een reportage over de kangoeroejacht, op haar beurt door het monster wordt aangevallen, moet men Jakes verhaal wel geloven.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"猎魔","overview":"杰克·卡伦（比尔·克尔）与他的孙子住在澳大利亚内陆当一个巨大的野猪剃刀鲸攻击他，破坏他的房子，杀害他的孙子。他被指控谋杀和他的尊严被破坏。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"MX","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Los colmillos del infierno","overview":"Una especie de cerdo salvaje aterroriza y asesina gente en una aislada ciudad del interior de Australia. La primera víctima resulta ser un niño y después, una periodista americana. Su marido, Carl, quiere averiguar la verdad pero los habitantes de la zona no se muestran muy amistosos. Sólo contará con la ayuda de un cazador y una mujer para encontrar a la bestia.","tagline":"Razorback: Los colmillos del infierno."},{"iso_639_1":"ro","iso_3166_1":"RO","name":"Română","english_name":"Romanian","title":"Fiara","overview":"Moartea misterioasă a unui copil duce la incriminarea bunicului său, care susține că ucigașul este un porc sălbatic de dimensiuni uriașe. Nimeni nu crede asemenea lucru deoarece animalul descris pare mai degrabă o creatură imaginară.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"O Corte da Navalha","overview":"Uma repórter ecologista desaparece no deserto australiano quando fazia uma matéria sobre a matança de animais. Seu marido sai em sua procura e encontra um javali gigante que ataca na região.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"CA","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"","overview":"Un soir, dans une maison isolée au milieu du désert australien, un vieil homme, Jake Cullen, et son petit-fils Scotty sont attaqués par un sanglier monstrueux. L'enfant disparaît et le grand-père, amputé d'une jambe, est un moment accusé du meurtre. Deux ans plus tard, Beth Winters, journaliste américaine, débarque dans la région pour enquêter sur un massacre de kangourous...","tagline":"Tuez-la ou elle vous tuera..."},{"iso_639_1":"cs","iso_3166_1":"CZ","name":"Český","english_name":"Czech","title":"Kanec","overview":"Australský filmový horor o klech obrovského divočáka a nebezpečí, které číhá v pusté australské divočině. Na počátku přijíždí z civilizované Ameriky do divoké australské buše mladá americká novinářka Beth Wintersová, aby se pokusila přispět svou prací k zastavení krutého vyvražďování klokanů. Vzápětí za záhadných okolností zahyne. Po jejích stopách se vydá manžel Carl Winters, aby se pokusil odhalit pravdu o okolnostech její smrti. Brzy se dostane na stopu strašlivé skutečnosti. V divočině, kde Beth pobývala, řádí obrovský kanec zabiják. Hrdinovi přichází na pomoc v boji proti monstróznímu zvířeti starý lovec, který má s netvorem také své dávné a dosud nevyřízené účty. Hyne však rozsápaný jeho strašlivými kly. Je tedy jen na Carlovi, aby se s kancem utkal...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"獵魔","overview":"傑克·卡倫（比爾·克爾）與他的孫子住在澳大利亞內陸當一個巨大的野豬剃刀鯨攻擊他，破壞他的房子，殺害他的孫子。他被指控謀殺和他的尊嚴被破壞。","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"","overview":"Στην αυστραλιανή ενδοχώρα, ένα άγριο αγριογούρουνο σκοτώνει και προκαλεί χάος σε μια μικρή κοινότητα.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ar","iso_3166_1":"SA","name":"العربية","english_name":"Arabic","title":"","overview":"في المناطق النائية من أستراليا، يعيث خنزير بري شرس قتلًا وخرابًا في مجتمع صغير.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ja","iso_3166_1":"JP","name":"日本語","english_name":"Japanese","title":"レイザーバック","overview":"","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"1QdZBezWMHk","site":"YouTube","type":"Clip","name":"An Unexpected Surprise..","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2024-04-1